  "notes": "Population/households are final ENUMERATED counts (census moment 00:00 15 June 2022, incl. floating population), not PEC-adjusted. Unit lists and population per district/upazila/city corporation/thana/paurashava/union/ward from the Community Report Excel files, sheet C-01 (BBS 2022 geocodes; code_scheme BBS_GEOCODE_2022 = C-01 code columns joined with '-', prefixed by division 40). City-corporation units carry the city-corporation code in the geocode, so wards and mahallas of Khulna City Corporation (40-47-33) are kept apart from paurashava wards. Jhenaidah's Excel (and the C-01 table of its Community Report PDF) prints no union codes and repeats the paurashava code in the Union/Ward column of ward rows; those union/ward codes are taken from the 'List of Geocodes of Jhenaidah District' in the Jhenaidah Community Report PDF (raw/community_report_geocodes.txt) and marked in notes; raw/c01_khulna_division.csv keeps the Excel as printed. Administrative-unit counts, area and density from the District Report Key Findings tables (District Series, June 2024) and Union Statistics (June 2025) Table D01. basis: enumerated | as stated (printed in a BBS table) | derived (counted from the C-01 geocode rows). Level 'cantonment' is used for Jashore Cantonment (Union/Ward column, code 998, under Jashore Sadar); level 'reserve_forest' for the four Sundarbans Reserve Forest units printed in the Union/Ward column with code 997 (Nalian Range in Dacope, Chandpai Range in Mongla, Sundarban (Reserve Forest) in Sharankhola, Satkhira Range in Shyamnagar); neither is a union parishad. Large PDFs/Excel are not committed; fetch.py --division khulna re-downloads them (bbs.gov.bd needs the Sectigo DV R36 intermediate, added at runtime from its AIA URL).",
